# One-off post-hoc analysis scripts. Each is pinned to a past run, sample or ID
# scheme, and none is needed to run a benchmark (that is run_benchmark.py plus the
# bench/ package). Kept on disk for the reasoning in their docstrings; untracked so
# they stop shipping with the product.
scripts/oneoff/
